==Battleground==
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*10 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to bring at least one cat with the [[Zombie Killer]] Ability, such as [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] or [[Mr. (Special Cat)|Hyper Mr]]. This will allow you to dispatch the Coffin Zoges quickly. After all 3 Zories are killed, you can feel free to spam your Zombie Killers. If you send them out beforehand, they will likely be killed by the Zories when they burrow. The Tackey can be killed early on if you lure it and kill it with a high-DPS unit such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]].

